## Waiver and Release
I, the undersigned visitor, acknowledge that I am participating in hunting and outdoor activities at Buck & Beard Hunt Club voluntarily and at my own risk.

### I understand and agree that:
1. Hunting and outdoor activities involve inherent risks and dangers
2. I assume all risks associated with participation
3. I release Buck & Beard Hunt Club from any liability
4. I will follow all club rules and safety protocols
5. I have adequate insurance coverage

### Safety Acknowledgment:
- I have been briefed on club safety rules
- I will wear required safety equipment
- I will not hunt under the influence of alcohol or drugs
- I will respect all property boundaries

